	(text "Charger (BQ24074)\n- EN1 = 1 (while VBUS present), EN2 = 0: USB500 mode,\n  input limited to 500 mA with VIN-DPM.\n- Fast charge 890 / 1.78k = 0.5 A (0.28 C for 1800 mAh).\n- Safety timers 56k: 45 min pre-charge, 7.5 h fast.\n- ILIM 1.5k only used if EN2 is set high (1.07 A).\n- ITERM open: charge ends at 10 % of the fast current.\n- VSYS = 4.4 V on USB, VBAT on battery.\n- CHG_N, PGOOD_N are open-drain; pull-ups are\n  on the MCU sheet.\n\nRails\n- VSYS: charger output, feeds 3V3, audio amp, OLED boost.\n- +3V3: always on (deep sleep keeps RTC + wake GPIOs)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b6cd9f88-cadb-5bdb-b543-1a4554b3f592")
	)
